---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import { breadcrumbSchema, pageSchema } from '../../lib/schema';

const crumbs = [{ label: 'About Bright Hope Therapy' }];
---

<Layout
  title="About Bright Hope Therapy | Meridian, Idaho"
  description="Learn about Bright Hope Therapy, a private counseling practice for adults in Meridian, Idaho."
  schema={pageSchema([breadcrumbSchema(crumbs, Astro.url.pathname)])}
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="About the practice"
    title="A private counseling practice with room for individual attention."
    intro="Bright Hope Therapy is Lisa Bright’s counseling practice in Meridian, Idaho, offering individual therapy for adults."
    crumbs={crumbs}
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container grid grid--2">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What you can expect</p>
        <h2>Counseling centered on the reason you came in.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Therapy begins with understanding what has been happening in your
          life and what you would like to be different. Some concerns are
          specific and easy to name. Others become clearer over time.
        </p>

        <p>
          You and Lisa can decide together what deserves attention, what pace
          feels manageable, and what kind of support may be useful.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tint">
    <div class="container grid grid--3">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Individual counseling</h3>
        <p>
          Bright Hope Therapy provides one-to-one counseling for adults. The
          work stays focused on your experiences, concerns, and goals.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>A collaborative process</h3>
        <p>
          Therapy is something you participate in rather than something done
          to you. Questions, preferences, uncertainty, and feedback are
          welcome.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Respect for what matters to you</h3>
        <p>
          Your relationships, values, culture, beliefs, and life circumstances
          can all be relevant to counseling without requiring you to fit a
          particular mold.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container grid grid--2">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Choosing where to begin</p>
        <h2>You do not need to know exactly what kind of therapy you need.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          The Services section describes some of the concerns people may bring
          to counseling. The Approaches section explains several methods Lisa
          may use during the work.
        </p>

        <p>
          Both are starting points. A conversation with Lisa can help you
          determine whether Bright Hope Therapy fits what you are looking for.
        </p>

        <div class="about-links">
          <a class="link-arrow" href="/services/">
            Explore therapy services
          </a>

          <a class="link-arrow" href="/approaches/">
            Explore therapy approaches
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tint">
    <div class="container grid grid--2">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Bright Hope Therapy in Meridian</p>
        <h2>Learn more about the counselor behind the practice.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Bright Hope Therapy is Lisa Bright’s private counseling practice.
          Her education, clinical training, professional credentials, and
          therapeutic background are described on her profile.
        </p>

        <a class="link-arrow" href="/about/lisa-bright/">
          Meet Lisa Bright, LCPC
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-links{
    display:grid;
    gap:.5rem;
    margin-top:1.25rem
  }
</style>
